    "PX4(WSL)": "同 X050: ① ActuatorEffectivenessCustom.cpp 恢复 enablePropellerTorque; ② ControlAllocator.cpp 弱权限轴阈值 0.05→0.005 (KM=0.0236 低于默认阈值会被清零)",
